      "content": "okay i'll try that. do you think it's okay if i take some ibuprofen too since my arm is starting to feel a bit tender and my head hurts a little? i'm also kinda worried about the dose since i don't know how many are left in the bottle, is like 4 or 5 at a time okay to kickstart it?",
